ezproxy_db.json — attribution and licence
=========================================

Source:  https://github.com/tom5760/ezproxy-db
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
         https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

`ezproxy_db.json` is a directory of publicly documented library proxy endpoints,
derived from the tom5760/ezproxy-db dataset. LitUbik reshapes the upstream
records into the {name, url, country} form its typeahead consumes; entries may
have been added or corrected locally.

CC BY-SA is a copyleft licence for the *data*: anyone redistributing this file,
or an adapted version of it, must keep this attribution and license the result
under CC BY-SA 4.0 as well. That obligation is on the file, not on LitUbik's
source code, which stays under the AGPL (see ../../../LICENSE).

No credential, no institutional account and no private endpoint is contained in
this file — only proxy URLs that the institutions themselves publish.
